    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de59d4a51190d1d57a33c6ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“德比训练员”",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa414f00a809df2dcea54c816f283d2bc6c495d33eeb7d73425d96fb3c84f00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c0aa65da241ca2db442cbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”迫在眉睫的某天，\n在特雷森学园举办了记者会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58deccadb12316cce2324d9213d2b5348545c8c431b608bd27bcfe82060660a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6ca50592e54ea5f215ccc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周为了实现和母亲们的约定──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc532dc7f5d24f902cf99efbc1404db582fadfc94747d0029366f9b17191a49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f844220555de9466be849843",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以及为了让训练员成为“德比训练员”，\n誓言要拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9289a646cf60214018ede84f3a05e4acd7457a3d94d2a626085b96926815cac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30691a84413b11e1b4fc9a8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "德比记者会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15db65b01c2ab9236087e1ebe6738124a0f22f8e77124ecc0dac564dbf7e8fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614e4782a9454862e014e9ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管在“日本德比”写下佳绩，\n但特别周的战斗才刚开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ccb618d6a7b180f2a492689a3de8c2b7360ee3ed6e4a16df210baeba730d2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8f311e5c15d2055564459b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在身边环绕着神鹰和草上飞等\n众多强大对手的状态下──",
      "source_fingerprint": "10bd1abbb983bd1264cae0de8fdd6de8272275f840333acc41d3fd389cc504e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defdd703d7b7967ccee0db62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "表情总是深藏不露的青云天空，\n向特别周预告了自己要在“菊花赏”\n以及“天皇赏（春）”和她一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9751f2806996eb84dc8b176342f654f89984fe7cb220a7a1e95729201647fb48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea09d2f6da4ac79b46bea3bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "劲敌登场，其名为……",
      "source_fingerprint": "156e36773578c38f0f7e7d57bfb734849f97edd61220aa6f65277c8582c7cb95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2262673bffadbca41c3c411f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周有确实留下好成绩，\n世人对她的评价也越来越高。但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77e03f6324cd9df3c54d129bd9c44b6d28ea5303969243c6aaeb9a44ffd4dd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c26532ca32719a72e5b1428",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有“怪鸟”神鹰、“怪物”草上飞\n这两座高墙挡在她的眼前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "273e9fa76e2bc6517b0f3cfa7c20490c6c293e9cc17ae39b8152a0f03e200dc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36bd53a7a2fbff205804b1e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后终于要迎接\n要和神鹰一决胜负的“日本杯”……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cafea154f511aa43e3cde98064e8592cdd9281a6492bc94e390435c577e30f93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c27da2f600a5ecbb41a9839",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“怪鸟”，以及“怪物”",
      "source_fingerprint": "15483b6032a8a0be44900a196a087e320e1c241f9b2da7275633fd74c0894dec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d10fbf05259793b6b1f6b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "见识到号称世代最强的草上飞实力，\n特别周受到强烈的打击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dedf4c0c2fb51d40136b0151d4f92ebdd5d9a22478b1a76725785c84bf3460f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d52cd20ce6433bded0a5b01e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员用肉身阻止了\n因焦躁而乱来的特别周。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e65615ae6ca4539e3b967dd2a4413ad5606af86b0dd807e4823cbc554079c2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c417e1016617ab1fc4fe10cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回忆起一路走来的过程，\n特别周重新找回自信，\n要用全新的心情挑战“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a10533463954e93521b6a41db9e7aa7c516a036b54f3c43367547c652bcb82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d4794f5bfdd5cc99a8f9e25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "燃烧的眼神，奋起",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c912d3f95b2c35e7bdd2796502dfd126e68584c3272070d9850be7651d4ece0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:582d978e83c20cd83573cf18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和特别周一起前往夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c86eead878e10c7d0c74f40135ea403ef4213ab2d78885b82439f935ee68b7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6137c5c6dc3d58fe2f84c34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "得鼓起干劲，\n为了“菊花赏”还有\n“天皇赏（春）”好好锻练才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9802816b936c2eea9eef24e40e78e46257626005dceb61d1f5abcb5a8aaae2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8fd662188afadef7cb0313",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第二年夏季集训开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa05083c0156e577b537c68720356d0d8e339451fdc10a34946c56c58454f2b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1001/storytimeline_501001406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46a6b897547dde0739e342a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年又到了要和特别周\n一起来夏季集训的季节。",
